  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liquefied Natural Gas (LNG) and Natural Gas Infrastructure Reverse Trade Mission (RTM), through Global Marketing &amp; Communications, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA-funded reverse trade mission (RTM) supports U.S. private sector participation in the implementation of gas infrastructure in Pakistan. The RTM supports USTDA&apos;s goal of developing gas infrastructure in emerging markets and the Government of Pakistan&apos;s intent to expand LNG imports and infrastructure. The RTM will share best practices for value-based natural gas infrastructure planning and technical capacity building and support opportunities for U.S. exports to Pakistan.</narrative>
  </description>
